Cell["\<\
The counts follow from the amounts: on the 3 \[Times] 3 grid, two new \
vertices over each of the 9 vertices, one vertical edge in each fiber and two \
horizontal edges over each of the 12 edges give 9 + 18 vertices and 12 + 18 + \
9 + 24 edges.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"c323bb88-064a-4a3d-94e1-1297ef547bfb"],

