  "e04b6fad-8c10-4613-9e84-fa324abfc22f"],
 " grows fibers with vertical edges too, but it keeps no base and no spokes, \
and its horizontal edges are a matching, not a draw. With one vertex over \
every vertex the two agree: the new vertices of the inflation span a copy of ",
 StyleBox["g", "TI"],
 ", as the total graph of the fibration does."
}], "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"1e5cea2f-4ada-4b87-9461-9e3fa886d5a1"],

